  [1mRoot cause:[0m the slice was [38;5;153mtext[i:i + chunk_size - 1][39m. Python slice ends are already exclusive, so the extra [38;5;153m- 1[39m
  truncated every chunk by one character, and because the [38;5;153mrange[39m stride was the full [38;5;153mchunk_size[39m, those characters were
  dropped from the output entirely rather than shifted into the next chunk.

  [1mFix:[0m [38;5;153mtext[i:i + chunk_size][39m.

